    "intro_narrative": "You awaken in the sealed sanctum of the mad Archmage, a sprawling chamber filled with ancient artifacts, glowing runes, and arcane machinery. The air crackles with latent magic. The sanctum doors are bound by an impenetrable spell, and the only way to escape is to complete the Archmage's final ritual. Scattered across the room are peculiar devices and magical relics. You must decipher the connections between these mystical tools, channeling their energies correctly to weave the ultimate spell of unbinding and secure your freedom before the sanctum collapses into the ethereal plane.",
    "narrative_style": "fantasy"
